  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-13T21:30:33.723Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the recent addition of the \"Earmuffs\" parameter, any avatar that had defined its own \"Earmuffs\" parameter was, of course, broken. To help avoid such problems happening in the future, please define a prefix that will be used for future VRChat-defined av3 parameters, so we can avoid using that prefix in our own parameters.",
